{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27038","headline":"哭贾岛二首 二 · 姚合","name":"哭贾岛二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳杳黄泉下，嗟君向此行。\n有名传後世，无子过今生。\n新墓松三尺，空堦月二更。\n从今旧诗卷，人觅写应争。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}